        "filing_date": "2025-11-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For over a decade, we have tracked human capital metrics that we consider to be key to our business, including health and safety, career growth and development, turnover, hiring and diversity, equity and inclusion.",
