        "filing_date": "2025-11-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For the medical end market, we develop components and subassemblies that support our medical manufacturing operations for products such as blood analyzers, food contamination analyzers, and specialized optical spectrometers and fluorometers utilizing the latest optical technologies.",
